{# verdict.knap: the taste verdict. Should you give a shit? The page a reader
   lands on: frontmatter built key by key, the verdict and the take, the case
   with a deep-linked pull quote, dealbreakers in a danger callout, a receipts
   table whose rows cite source pages and footnotes, fine print folded away,
   the source list, and the whole apparatus page folded in as an embed.
   apparatus.knap renders the second page, the citations, from the same data.
   Callout kinds and titles, table headers and section headings belong to the
   template; the model writes values only. Shape: shapes/verdict.json.
   Engine notes (k4o main, knap 0.6 semantics):
   - fragment_link links only arrays of two or more items and passes a lone
     string through, so a single quote is padded with an empty item by merge,
     linked, then unwrapped with first.
   - Tables are written out with --- delimiter rows. The table filter emits
     single-dash rows, which dogbed does not render as an html table.
   - An optional block opens with its if tag and an empty string output on
     one line. That line renders as the blank separator when the block is
     taken and disappears when it is not, so every combination of fields
     gets single blank lines and one trailing newline.
   - Whitespace right after an opening tag, or after an inline block that
     rendered nothing, is dropped. Inline conditionals therefore always take
     a branch (if/else) and keep their spaces outside the tags. #}{% set subj = subject ?? title %}
{% set level = gaf ?? "unrated" %}
{% set as_of = date ?? "press time" %}
---
{{ title | yaml_property:"title" }}
{{ subj | yaml_property:"subject" }}
{{ verdict | yaml_property:"verdict" }}
{{ level | yaml_property:"gaf" }}
{% if subject %}{{ subject | kebab | yaml_property:"slug" }}
{% endif %}
{% if date %}{{ date | yaml_property:"date" }}
{% endif %}
{% if tags %}{{ tags | yaml_property:"tags" }}
{% endif %}
{% if sources %}{{ sources | map:"name" | wikilink | yaml_property:"sources" }}
{% endif %}
{% if apparatus_page %}{{ apparatus_page | wikilink | yaml_property:"apparatus" }}
{% endif %}
{% if related %}{{ related | wikilink | yaml_property:"related" }}
{% endif %}
---
{{ title | h1 }}

{{ verdict | bold }} — {{ take }}

Give-a-shit level: {{ level | bold }} · sources cited: {{ sources | length }} · as of {{ as_of }}

{{ "The case" | h2 }}

{{ summary }}
{% if pull_quote %}{{ "" }}
{{ pull_quote.text | merge:"" | fragment_link:pull_quote.url | first | callout:("quote", "Straight from the source") }}
{% endif %}
{% if blockers %}{{ "" }}
{{ "Blockers" | h2 }}

{{ blockers | list | callout:("danger", "Dealbreakers") }}
{% endif %}
{% if receipts %}{{ "" }}
{{ "Receipts" | h2 }}

| Claim | Evidence | Source |
| --- | --- | --- |
{% for r in receipts %}
| {{ r.claim }} | {% if r.note %}{{ r.evidence }}[^{{ r.note | kebab }}]{% else %}{{ r.evidence }}{% endif %} | {% if r.source %}{{ r.source | wikilink }}{% else %}unsourced{% endif %} |
{% endfor %}
{% endif %}

{{ "Verdict" | h2 }}

{{ bottom_line }}
{% if caveats %}{{ "" }}
{{ caveats | list | callout:("warning", "Fine print", true) }}
{% endif %}
{% if sources %}{{ "" }}
{{ "Sources" | h2 }}

{% for s in sources %}
- {{ s.name | wikilink }} · {{ s.rel | code }} · reliability {{ s.reliability | bold }} · give-a-shit {{ s.gaf }} · {{ s.url | link:"source" }}
{% endfor %}
{% endif %}
{% if apparatus_page %}{{ "" }}
{{ apparatus_page | embed | callout:("info", "The full apparatus", true) }}
{% endif %}
{% if related %}{{ "" }}
See also: {{ related | wikilink | join:" · " }}
{% endif %}
{% if footnotes %}{{ "" }}
{{ "Footnotes" | h2 }}

{{ footnotes | footnote }}
{% endif %}
